{"step_index":62,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T00:04:16Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-07T09:04:16+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-07T09:04:18+09:00\nThe search for \"site:k-tass.com CEO 황성현\" returned the following summary:\n주식회사 타스(K-TASS)의 CEO는 황성현입니다[1][2].\n\n주식회사 타스는 자동화 장비 분야의 기업으로, 경상남도 김해시 주촌면 서부로 1403번길 75에 위치하고 있습니다[3][4][5][6]. 황성현 대표는 창의적 설계, 정밀한 제작, 안정적인 품질 관리를 통해 고객 만족을 최우선으로 하며, '기술로 미래를, 신뢰로 가치를'이라는 경영 철학을 강조하고 있습니다[1][7][2][8].\n\nSources:\n[1] [k-tass.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIyCaMuapnXvzslb534LFS0TrQrTuS7InGDReE9VyDlPQXjIcL7e-DgU-jXj_hJO1u2d89PgK3OPdihZhVWUkHx5oSMlVjnhJAVA8QCiGnoEU=)\n[2] [k-tass.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIyCaMuapnXvzslb534LFS0TrQrTuS7InGDReE9VyDlPQXjIcL7e-DgU-jXj_hJO1u2d89PgK3OPdihZhVWUkHx5oSMlVjnhJAVA8QCiGnoEU=)\n[3] [k-tass.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIyCaMuapnXvzslb534LFS0TrQrTuS7InGDReE9VyDlPQXjIcL7e-DgU-jXj_hJO1u2d89PgK3OPdihZhVWUkHx5oSMlVjnhJAVA8QCiGnoEU=)\n[4] [k-tass.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIyCaMuapnXvzslb534LFS0TrQrTuS7InGDReE9VyDlPQXjIcL7e-DgU-jXj_hJO1u2d89PgK3OPdihZhVWUkHx5oSMlVjnhJAVA8QCiGnoEU=)\n[5] [k-tass.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIyCaMuapnXvzslb534LFS0TrQrTuS7InGDReE9VyDlPQXjIcL7e-DgU-jXj_hJO1u2d89PgK3OPdihZhVWUkHx5oSMlVjnhJAVA8QCiGnoEU=)\n[6] [k-tass.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIyCaMuapnXvzslb534LFS0TrQrTuS7InGDReE9VyDlPQXjIcL7e-DgU-jXj_hJO1u2d89PgK3OPdihZhVWUkHx5oSMlVjnhJAVA8QCiGnoEU=)\n[7] [k-tass.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIyCaMuapnXvzslb534LFS0TrQrTuS7InGDReE9VyDlPQXjIcL7e-DgU-jXj_hJO1u2d89PgK3OPdihZhVWUkHx5oSMlVjnhJAVA8QCiGnoEU=)\n[8] [k-tass.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIyCaMuapnXvzs